ns.\n- Verified health post-rollback before opening the incident.\n\n**Incident opened:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) \u2014 describes the failure, the rollback, the partial-failure/retry, the current state, and follow-ups (root-cause v2.3.1; investigate the orchestrator error). The create call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it had been created, so I did not retry.", "type": "text"}]}]}